invalid type: string "Karnani Industrial Bank, Limited vs The Province Of Bengal And\nOthers on 14 May, 1951\nEquivalent citations: 1951 AIR 285, 1951 SCR 560\nAuthor: Saiyid Fazal Ali\nBench: Saiyid Fazal Ali, B.K. Mukherjea, N. Chandrasekhara Aiyar\n           PETITIONER:\nKARNANI INDUSTRIAL BANK, LIMITED\n        Vs.\nRESPONDENT:\nTHE PROVINCE OF BENGAL AND OTHERS\nDATE OF JUDGMENT:\n14/05/1951